silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_flat_sections_08_preserved_material_02_yoneda_hom_leg a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "FunctorialTransportDocumentExtractionYonedaHomLegExample" .
silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_flat_sections_08_preserved_material_02_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'FunctorialTransportDocumentExtractionYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, F sends each household household-side object to a clinic schema object; the functor pair-of-assignments names this leg.; also, F sends each household typed arrow to a clinic typed arrow with matching domain and codomain assignments." .
